n now requires ObservedWriteScope to cover what a deliverable forces, and shipping only the detector would have left every future plan free to repeat the omission. Second, the non-lifecycle .ngrace/ ratchet pins exactly zero, measured across the archive; no approved spec or plan was ever written undeclared, which converts immutability from an intention into a regression that goes red the day it is violated.</Verdict></Verdicts></C-DECLARED-WRITES></NgraceRunLedger>
